---
/**
 * @fileoverview 离线页面
 * @description 当用户断网时显示的友好提示页面
 */
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>离线 - PixelVerse</title>
  <meta name="description" content="您已离线，请检查网络连接" />
  <style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
      background: #0a0a0a;
      color: #e5e5e5;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 2rem;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 480px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .icon {
      font-size: 4rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      opacity: 0.6;
    }
    h1 {
      font-size: 1.75rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6366f1, #8b5cf6);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      background-clip: text;
    }
    p {
      color: #a3a3a3;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }
    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
      background: #6366f1;
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-weight: 500;
      transition: background 0.2s;
      border: none;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    .btn:hover { background: #4f46e5; }
    .tips {
      margin-top: 2rem;
      padding-top: 1.5rem;
      border-top: 1px solid #262626;
      text-align: left;
    }
    .tips li {
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
      color: #737373;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">📡</div>
    <h1>你已离线</h1>
    <p>请检查你的网络连接，然后重试。</p>
    <button class="btn" onclick="window.location.reload()">
      重新加载
    </button>
    <ul class="tips">
      <li>检查 Wi-Fi 或移动数据是否开启</li>
      <li>尝试访问其他页面以确认网络状态</li>
      <li>已访问过的文章可能已被缓存，可以尝试返回</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
